# Committed on purpose, and the rule above stays as it is so the next `.env` is still caught.
# Vite compiles every `VITE_*` value into the browser bundle, so these three reach anyone who
# loads the page whether or not they are in the repository: they are public by construction, and
# nothing that is actually a secret belongs in this file.
!frontend/.env

